==History==
2020
*The Electro Giant was once available in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Electro Giant Draft Challenge]], which started on 5/10/2020. In this [[Tournament|challenge]], gameplay was similar to a regular Draft Challenge, except that one of the players was able to choose who would use the Electro Giant. If the player achieved at least 6 wins, they obtained the Electro Giant early.
*On 14/10/2020, prior to the [[Cards|card]]'s general release, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (14/10/2020)|maintenance break]], increased the Electro Giant's hitpoints by 12.5%.
*The Electro Giant card was generally released on 2/11/2020.
*On 18/11/2020, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Improvement%20Update%20(18/11/2020)|Clan Wars Improvement Update]], made the Electro Giant's reflected damage scale with his level. Additionally, certain interactions with the reflected damage were changed. For example, each of the [[Hunter]]'s pellets no longer count as individual attacks versus the Electro Giant. Previously, if the Hunter hit the Electro Giant from a point-blank range, the Hunter would take reflected damage 10 times and die instantly.
*On 19/11/2020, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (19/11/2020)|maintenance break]], fixed a bug where using [[Lightning]] on an Electro Giant would cause the game to crash.
2021
*On 30/3/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%201%20Update%20(30/3/2021)|2021 Quarter 1 Update]], added the Electro Giant to all Draft selections.
*On 6/9/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(6/9/2021)|2021 Quarter 3 Update]], decreased the Electro Giant's hitpoints by 4%.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
*On 1/11/2021, an [[Version History#Optional Update (1/11/2021)|Optional Update]], fixed an issue where Electro Giant could not stun some enemies.
*On 15/11/2021, a [[Version History#Minor Update (15/11/2021)|Minor Update]], fixed an issue where the Electro Giant counter-zaps would causes incorrect damage to enemy units.
2022
*On 30/3/2022, the [[Version History#Miner%20Update%20(30/3/2022)|Miner Update]], fixed a few bugs on the Electro Giant such as with his zap damage behaving inconsistently, a rare crash when Electro Giant received certain types of damage, and an issue where the Electro Giant's [[Star Points|Star Level]] used the sound effects of the [[Giant]].
*On 4/4/2022, the [[Version History#April%202022%20Update%20(4/4/2022)|April 2022 Update]], decreased the Electro Giant cost to 7 [[Elixir]] (from 8 Elixir), but also decreased his hitpoints and damage by 15%.
*On 7/6/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/6/2022)|Balance Update]], increased the Electro Giant's hitpoints by 9%.
*On 2/8/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(2/8/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Electro Giant's reflected tower damage by 33%.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Electro Giant from Electro Valley to Rascal's Hideout.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], fixed a bug where Electro Giant's Zap Pack would not deal reduced damage to the [[King's Tower|King Tower]].
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], added a 2-tile sight clip to the Electro Giant.
*On 31/3/2024, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Electro Giant's hitpoints by 0.02% and increased his reflected tower damage by 37.5%. It also fixed a bug where Electro Giant would not always be knocked back when hit by [[Mega Knight/Evolution|Evolved Mega Knight]].
*On 1/4/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (1/4/2025)|maintenance break]], decreased the Electro Giant's reflected tower damage by 33%.
2026

* On 4/5/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Electro Giant's attack time interval to 1.8 seconds (from 2.1 seconds) and his first attack time interval to 1 second (from 1.5 seconds), but also decreased his reflected tower damage by 24%.
* On 6/7/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Electro Giant's hitpoints by 3%.

